---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Scripture from '../components/Scripture.astro';
import WaveDivider from '../components/WaveDivider.astro';

const together = [
  'We pray together',
  'We worship together',
  'We serve together',
  'We grow together',
  'We reach people together',
  'We carry one another together',
];

const pastorCommits = [
  'I will serve you',
  'I will pray for you',
  'I will teach you the Word',
  'I will encourage you',
  'I will lead by example',
];

const memberAsks = [
  'Pray for me',
  'Pray for my family',
  'Stand with the church',
  'Support the vision',
  'Serve one another',
  'Walk faithfully with Jesus',
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Belonging & Membership"
  description="Becoming part of El Shaddai Living Waters Church means more than attending on Sunday. The vision becomes our vision. The mission becomes our mission."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Belonging"
    title="More than attending on a Sunday"
    lede="If you decide to become part of El Shaddai Living Waters Church, you are not simply becoming someone who attends Sunday services. You become part of the vision and mission of the church."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <div class="prose-measure">
      <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl leading-relaxed text-blue-900">
        The vision becomes our vision.<br />
        The mission becomes our mission.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-12 grid gap-x-10 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {together.map((t) => (
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-t border-gold-500/30 pt-4">
          <span class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-600"></span>
          <span class="leading-snug text-ink">{t}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="prose-measure mt-12">
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink">
        Church is not a place where one person does everything.
      </p>
      <Scripture reference="1 Corinthians 12:27">
        Now you are the body of Christ, and each one of you is a part of it.
      </Scripture>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3">
      {[
        'Every person has a place',
        'Every person has a gift',
        'Every person has a responsibility',
      ].map((t) => (
        <li class="rounded-xl border border-gold-500/30 bg-surface p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <p class="font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-semibold text-blue-900">
            {t}
          </p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <WaveDivider />

  <!-- Accountability -->
  <section class="bg-blue-900 text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
      <SectionHeading
        eyebrow="Pastor and Members"
        title="We are accountable to one another"
        tone="dark"
      />

      <div class="prose-measure mt-8">
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-white/85">
          I want to make something very clear as Pastor. I am accountable to God
          first, and I am also accountable to the church to faithfully serve,
          teach and shepherd according to the Word of God.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-white/85">
          And as members, you also have a responsibility to walk according to the
          Word of God and support the vision and mission of the church. This is
          not one sided. Pastor and members need one another.
        </p>

        <Scripture reference="Hebrews 13:17" tone="dark">
          Have confidence in your leaders and submit to their authority, because
          they keep watch over you as those who must give an account.
        </Scripture>

        <p class="leading-relaxed text-white/85">
          This verse reminds me that I have to give an account for how I shepherd
          God&rsquo;s people.
        </p>

        <Scripture reference="1 Peter 5:2–3" tone="dark">
          Be shepherds of God&rsquo;s flock that is under your care … not lording
          it over those entrusted to you, but being examples to the flock.
        </Scripture>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-14">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold-300">
            So as Pastor
          </h3>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
            {pastorCommits.map((c) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-white/15 pb-3">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#D8A830" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-white/90">{c}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold-300">
            And I ask you
          </h3>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
            {memberAsks.map((c) => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-white/15 pb-3">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#D8A830" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                <span class="text-white/90">{c}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <div class="prose-measure">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">
        If our vision and mission speak to your heart, we would be blessed to
        have you become part of what God is doing through El Shaddai Living
        Waters Church Sydney.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/visit"
          class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-gold-500 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-900 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-gold-300"
        >
          Plan your visit
        </a>
        <a
          href="/welcome"
          class="inline-flex rounded-lg border border-blue-900/25 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-900 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-blue-900/5"
        >
          A note from the Pastor
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
